---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<div class="container home">
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="intro-text">
      <h1 class="intro-name">Dominic Critchlow</h1>
      <p>I'm a forward-deployed product manager at <a href="https://www.ode.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ode with Anthropic</a> in New York.</p>
      <p>Before Ode I spent nearly a decade in national security. I co-founded Gamechanger at the Department of Defense's Chief Digital and AI Office, then served as Chief Scientist for Booz Allen Hamilton in Europe.</p>
      <p>I teach graduate analytics at Seton Hall and serve in the U.S. Army Reserve. On my own time I make iOS apps and data projects.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="intro-sun">
      <a class="sun" href="/helio/" aria-label="Today's sun, drawn from NOAA data. See Helio.">
        <canvas id="sun" width="252" height="252" role="img" aria-label="Today's sun with its active regions"></canvas>
      </a>
      <figcaption class="sun-caption" id="sun-caption">The sun today</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Selected work</h2>
    <ul class="index-list work-list">
      <li><a href="/helio/"><img class="work-icon" src="/public/helio/icon.png" alt="" />Helio</a><span>iOS weather app for the sun, the Earth, and the moon</span></li>
      <li><a href="/pinned/"><img class="work-icon" src="/public/pinned/icon.png" alt="" />Pinned</a><span>iOS app for saving the places you care about</span></li>
      <li><a href="/flags/"><span class="work-icon work-glyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 21V4"/><path d="M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5"/></svg></span>Flags</a><span>Every country mentioned in U.S. congressional language</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/dod-advana/gamechanger" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="work-icon work-glyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><circle cx="11.5" cy="14" r="2.5"/><path d="M13.3 15.8L15.5 18"/></svg></span>Gamechanger</a><span>AI policy search for the Department of Defense</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="section-link"><a href="/projects/">All projects</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Writing</h2>
    <ul class="index-list">
      {%- for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
      <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a><span>{{ post.date | year }}</span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="section-link"><a href="/writing/">All writing</a></p>
  </section>
</div>

<script src="/public/sun.js" defer></script>
